{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44928","headline":"中秋夜君山脚下看月 · 无可","name":"中秋夜君山脚下看月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汹涌吹苍雾，朦朣吐玉盘。\n雨师清滓秽，川后扫波澜。\n气射繁星灭，光笼八表寒。\n来驱云涨晚，路上碧霄宽。\n熠燿游何在，蟾蜍食渐难。\n棹飞银电碎，林映白虹攒。\n水魄连空合，霜辉压树乾。\n夜深高不动，天下仰头看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}